<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Aftermarket at $13.50.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Aftermarket at $13.50.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Aftermarket Technology Corp shares were priced at $13.50</p>
<p>each for their IPO.</p>
<p>Estimated Pricing Range $12.50-14.50</p>
<p>   Number of Shares	   3.5 million</p>
<p>   Underwriters   Morgan Stanley, William Blair, DLJ</p>
<p>   Headquarters		  Federal Way, Washington</p>
<p>   Description    remakes drive train products for autos</p>
